 This is the source code of [Fizzy](https://fizzy.do/), the Kanban tracking tool for issues and ideas by [37signals](https://37signals.com).
 
 
+## Deploying
+
+To run your own Fizzy on a single Linux server with Docker, see our
+[Single-server deployment guide](docs/deployment.md). Fill in your
+hostname, mail server and secrets in `config/deploy.yml`, run
+`bin/kamal setup`, and Fizzy will be live at `https://your-hostname`
+with SQLite data persisted across deploys.
+
 ## Development
 
 You are welcome -- and encouraged -- to modify Fizzy to your liking.
